# multivibrator: the two-transistor astable multivibrator (circuits/multivibrator.toml),
# Manhattan style on a ground-plane tile (decision C24): the tile is the core,
# a post a net; planned by search (cp:b_uild).
circuit multivibrator
core P1 manhattan-tile
net VCC P1.5 P1.10 R1.1 R2.1 R3.1 R4.1 BT1.1
net LED1 P1.2 R1.2 D1.1
net C1N P1.3 D1.2 Q1.3 C1.1
net B2 P1.4 C1.2 R2.2 Q2.2
net LED2 P1.7 R4.2 D2.1
net C2N P1.8 D2.2 Q2.3 C2.1
net B1 P1.9 C2.2 R3.2 Q1.2
net GND P1.1 P1.6 Q1.1 Q2.1 BT1.2
